{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13070","headline":"酬萧二十七侍御初秋言怀 · 郎士元","name":"酬萧二十七侍御初秋言怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚客秋多兴，江林月渐生。\n细枝凉叶动，极浦早鸿声。\n胜赏睽前夕，新诗报远情。\n曲高慙和者，惆怅闭寒城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郎士元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13070.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13070","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}